  "type": "page",
  "content": "<a href=\"/#portofolio\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M257.5 445.1l-22.2 22.2c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0L7 273c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L201.4 44.7c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l22.2 22.2c9.5 9.5 9.3 25-.4 34.3L136.6 216H424c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24v32c0 13.3-10.7 24-24 24H136.6l120.5 114.8c9.8 9.3 10 24.8.4 34.3z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBack\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t<p>Project &gt;</p><p>DopaMind</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>DopaMind - Productivity OS</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p data-path-to-node=\"4\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Project Overview:</b> DopaMind is a comprehensive personal growth ecosystem designed to eliminate \"app switching fatigue.\" By unifying finance tracking, atomic habits, and daily planning into a single \"Modern Monolith,\" it provides users with a cohesive workspace to manage their lives and maintain long-term focus.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"5\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Challenge (Problem):</b> Most productivity tools are fragmented—users often track finances in one app, habits in another, and tasks elsewhere. This lack of integration leads to a disjointed view of personal progress. Furthermore, traditional web apps often feel sluggish, breaking the \"flow state\" required for high productivity.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"6\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Solution (Engineering &amp; Design):</b></p><ul data-path-to-node=\"7\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Modern Monolith Architecture:</b> Built with <b data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"41\">Laravel 11 and Inertia.js</b>, delivering a seamless Single Page Application (SPA) experience without the complexity of a separate API.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Reactive Habit Tracking:</b> Leveraged <b data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"35\">Vue 3</b> to create a highly responsive habit dashboard with real-time streak visualizations and progress heatmaps.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Unified Data Engine:</b> Engineered a robust database schema that allows users to link financial goals with daily behavioral habits, creating a truly integrated productivity experience.</p></li></ul>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2><a href=\"https://dopamindapp.up.railway.app/\">🔗Link</a></h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://zerocloud-compress.vercel.app/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLive Demo\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"08b9e04\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"20\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTk4NiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMDdcLzIwLnBuZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6IjA4YjllMDQifQ%3D%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/20.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/20.png\" alt=\"20\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"08b9e04\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"21\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTk4NywidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMDdcLzIxLTEucG5nIiwic2xpZGVzaG93IjoiMDhiOWUwNCJ9\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/21-1.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/21-1.png\" alt=\"21\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"08b9e04\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"22\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTk4OCwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMDdcLzIyLTEucG5nIiwic2xpZGVzaG93IjoiMDhiOWUwNCJ9\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/22-1.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/22-1.png\" alt=\"22\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"08b9e04\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"23\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTk4OSwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMDdcLzIzLTEucG5nIiwic2xpZGVzaG93IjoiMDhiOWUwNCJ9\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/23-1.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/23-1.png\" alt=\"23\" /></figure></a>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M646 125C629 125 613 133 604 142L308 442C296 454 292 471 292 487 292 504 296 521 308 533L604 854C617 867 629 875 646 875 663 875 679 871 692 858 704 846 713 829 713 812 713 796 708 779 692 767L438 487 692 225C700 217 708 204 708 187 708 171 704 154 692 142 675 129 663 125 646 125Z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M696 533C708 521 713 504 713 487 713 471 708 454 696 446L400 146C388 133 375 125 354 125 338 125 325 129 313 142 300 154 292 171 292 187 292 204 296 221 308 233L563 492 304 771C292 783 288 800 288 817 288 833 296 850 308 863 321 871 338 875 354 875 371 875 388 867 400 854L696 533Z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p><b data-path-to-node=\"21\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Result:</b> A unified productivity powerhouse that streamlines the daily grind into a single, elegant interface. DopaMind successfully reduces cognitive load by centralizing disparate life-management tools, allowing users to focus more on <i data-path-to-node=\"21\" data-index-in-node=\"239\">execution</i> and less on <i data-path-to-node=\"21\" data-index-in-node=\"261\">organization</i>.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2> <strong data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"407\">Tech Stack</strong></h2>\t\t\t\t\n    Laravel 11\n    Vue 3\n    Inertia.js\n    Tailwind CSS\n<style>\n.kh-stack-grid {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 10px;\n    margin: 15px 0;\n}\n.kh-badge {\n    padding: 6px 14px;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n    transition: all 0.3s ease;\n}\n.kh-badge:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }\n/* DopaMind Brand Colors */\n.laravel { background-color: #FF2D20; color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #c7251b; }\n.vue { background-color: #42b883; color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #33a06f; }\n.inertia { background-color: #9553e9; color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #7d3ed3; }\n.tailwind { background-color: #38bdf8; color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #0ea5e9; }\n</style>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>🧩 <strong data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"407\">Topic Area</strong></h2>\t\t\t\t\n    📈 Habit Building\n    💰 Finance Tracking\n    ⚡ Performance SPA\n    🧠 Behavioral Psychology\n<style>\n.topic-container-horizontal {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 10px;\n    margin-top: 15px;\n}\n.topic-pill-v2 {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n    padding: 6px 14px;\n    border-radius: 50px;\n    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    transition: all 0.3s ease;\n}\n.topic-icon { margin-right: 8px; font-size: 16px; }\n</style>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>🛠️ <strong data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"961\">Skills Used</strong></h2>\t\t\t\t\n            Full-stack Dev (Laravel + Inertia)\n            100%\n            Reactive UI (Vue 3)\n            100%\n            Database Schema Design\n            100%\n<style>\n.skills-used-container { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; margin: 20px 0; }\n.skill-item { margin-bottom: 15px; }\n.skill-info {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin-bottom: 5px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #ffffff;\n}\n.progress-bar-v2 {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 6px;\n    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n.progress-fill-v2 {\n    height: 100%;\n    background-color: #50FFD9;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(80, 255, 217, 0.4);\n    transition: width 1.5s ease-in-out;\n}\n</style>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>⭐ Key Features</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<ul><li><p data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Atomic Habit Dashboard:</b> Visual streak tracking and heatmaps to reinforce positive behaviors.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"20,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Smart Finance Tracker:</b> Integrated budgeting tool with categorized expense analytics.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"20,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Blazing Fast SPA:</b> Zero-reload navigation for a smooth, app-like desktop experience.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"20,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Custom Task Engine:</b> Advanced to-do management with priority-based sorting.</p></li></ul>"
}